  dialogues:
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: faae18d800cc30e4e9816a84a98f9fee, type: 3}
    subtitle: "I\u2019ve added protective vests to the catalog. It\u2019s rated for
      high-impact trauma, which seems to be your primary hobby lately."
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d5cf93dbc70422445bc168a3cb4a2f43, type: 3}
    subtitle: "Unlocking the chest plate. It covers the most important organs. The
      ones that don't make you scream so loudly when they\u2019re poked."
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bc8b92ec3b47ba54e8db3dfd17e74b43, type: 3}
    subtitle: You can now wear metal and plastic to compensate for your soft, squishy
      evolutionary mistakes.
